            "review_text": "dandan397\nHanoi, Vietnam21 contributions\n0\nHorrible, horrible staff\nApr 2017 • Couples\nThe staff are awful here, don't waste your time or money in this place. Drinks are the same as other coffee shops, maybe slightly worse and the staff are soooooooo bad. They dump one menu down between two people (whilst holding a spare), hover over you huffing and puffing whilst you look through it. Anything you ask for elicits a rude response. It's like they really dislike foreigners or at least that's the vibes I got. I am not usually one to complain but this place is awful. Don't go.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 19, 2017",
