            "review_text": "Ellen M\nGeldermalsen, The Netherlands67 contributions\n0\nWorst service ever\nJul 2016 • Couples\nWe were here two times, only because we had to wait for our boat and bus and they do have good Wifi. Drinks and food are OK, nothing special and the choice is very limited. But I have to say that both times the service was very bad. The staff has a great time together, makes a lot of noise while speaking and laughing with each other and they don't pay any attention on their guests. We always had to get up and walk to them if we wanting something. When we ask for something the staff replied like everything was too much to ask and they weren't friendly at all.\nSo, good place to sleep on one of the couches (they don't care) and using their wifi, but don't expect it to be fun.\nRead more\nWritten July 19, 2016",
